# Eight turns over a view of eight written elements. The first read asks whether 7 lies below the length; every later read meets that question answered, in a block that does not stand behind its branch:
# the length was narrowed there by a test that the block does not follow, and the verifier stopped the build under check=Validate and in every build with assertions.
